WEBVTT

00:28:56.621 --> 00:29:03.246
But I, I feel like it's one of those
lessons that not having an ending,

00:29:03.496 --> 00:29:07.329
it just makes it harder. I know it
sounds so obvious and so easy,

00:29:07.329 --> 00:29:11.996
but when you take that leap of faith, when
Stephen King starts writing a novel,

00:29:12.371 --> 00:29:15.579
he gets to finish that novel and decide,
does anyone need to see this?

00:29:15.996 --> 00:29:19.871
And I'm sure he's got drawers full of
things that people have not read

00:29:20.204 --> 00:29:22.413
because he feels like it's not the thing.

00:29:22.413 --> 00:29:25.454
And one of the crazy things
that this, you know,

00:29:25.454 --> 00:29:29.829
pandemic quarantine time
has done for TV and

00:29:29.829 --> 00:29:34.621
for movies is it's given
people time to write,